## [Secrets managed by third party applications](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/managed-external-secrets.md)

### [Integration Partners](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partners.md)

Secrets Manager natively integrates with third party applications to rotate secrets held by the partner.

- [Big ID Refresh Token](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-BigId.md)
- [Cisco Security Platform API Key](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-CiscoSecurityPlatformApiKey.md)
- [Confluent Cloud API Key](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-ConfluentCloudApiKey.md)
- [Datadog Admin Key](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-DatadogAdminKey.md)
- [Datadog API Key](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-DatadogApiKey.md)
- [Datadog Application Key](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-DatadogApplicationKey.md)
- [GitLab Access Token](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-GitLabAccessToken.md)
- [Jenkins API Token](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-JenkinsApiToken.md)
- [MongoDB Atlas Database User](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-MongoDBAtlasDatabaseUser.md)
- [MongoDB Atlas Service Account Credentials](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-MongoDBAtlasServiceAccount.md)
- [Netskope API Token](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-NetskopeApiToken.md)
- [Paddle API Key](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-PaddleApiKey.md)
- [Salesforce Client Secret](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-salesforce.md)
- [Snowflake Key Pair](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-Snowflake.md)
- [Snowflake Programmatic Access Token](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-SnowflakePat.md)
- [SonarQube Token](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-partner-SonarQubeToken.md)
- [Security and permissions](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-security.md): Managed external secrets does not require you to share admin-level privileges of your third party application accounts with AWS.
- [Monitor and troubleshoot](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-monitor.md): Managed external secrets provide comprehensive monitoring capabilities through AWS CloudTrail logs and Amazon CloudWatch metrics.
- [Migrating existing secrets](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-migrating.md): You have an option to migrate your existing partner secrets to managed external secrets.
- [Limitations and considerations](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/mes-limitations-and-considerations.md): Managed external secrets does not support ephemeral secrets with lifespans less than four hours.


