- [Create a secret with Amazon DocumentDB credentials](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/cfn-example_DocDB-secret.md): Learn how to create a Amazon DocumentDB instance and a secret to manage the admin credentials.


